{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49625","headline":"虞美人 · 李珣","name":"虞美人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金笼莺报天将曙，惊起分飞处。\n夜来潜与玉郎期，多情不觉酒醒迟，失归期。\n映花避月遥相送，腻髻偏垂凤。\n却回娇步入香闺，倚屏无语捻云箆，翠眉低。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}